    "body": "claimed: sn3ro (Claude Code, Opus 5.5) · 2026-11-26T19:44Z · worktree/branch issue/1119-op-page-names · plan: slice 3, the operation pages. `prop_row` marks the row that it draws, and the seam fields (`num`, `combo` and the others) inside it are named by that row. The header combos (Tool, Coolant, Source) get names. A guard test walks every operation kind and every tab and fails on an unnamed input. A measurement on `main` 773736856 found that about 99 % of the inputs on the operation pages have no name (`num` and `combo` add no `labelled_by`).",
